---
import ResourcePageLayout from "../../../layouts/ResourcePageLayout.astro";
---

<ResourcePageLayout
  title="The Liquid Network"
  description="What is the Liquid Network? Bitcoin's sidechain for faster, more private transactions."
  lang="en"
>
  <section class="nav-buttons">
    <a href="/en/learn/lightning" class="nav-btn">The Lightning Network</a>
    <a href="/en/learn/ecash" class="nav-btn">eCash</a>
    <a href="/en/get-started/hardware-wallets" class="nav-btn">Hardware wallets</a>
  </section>

  <section class="content-section links-section">
    <p>
      <strong>Whitepaper (PDF):</strong>
      <a href="/pdf/liquid-whitepaper.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Strong Federations</a>
      (Back et al.) — the technical foundation for the Liquid sidechain.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="content-section">
    <div class="feature-block">
      <div class="feature-text">
        <p>
          Liquid is a network that uses a number of interconnected participants —
          including online exchanges and other Bitcoin companies — who together
          ensure that the bitcoin which is locked up (and now exists and can be
          moved around on the Liquid network) is backed 1:1. All these participants
          operate within a larger setup where it would take 2/3 + 1 of them
          cheating to deviate from the 1:1 ratio between the amount of bitcoin
          locked up and the amount of Bitcoin tokens on the Liquid network. These
          tokens are known as Liquid Bitcoin (L-BTC). Liquid is also described as a
          sidechain to Bitcoin.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-image">
        <img
          src="/images/logos/liquid.svg"
          alt="Liquid Network logo"
        />
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="content-section">
    <h2>Features and security</h2>
    <p>
      This also means that, unlike the Lightning Network, Liquid is partially
      centralized — but, all things considered, still very secure, since it would
      take quite a few participants in a large conspiracy to cheat. Some of the
      things Liquid offers are confidential, fast, and cheap transactions with a
      block time of just 1 minute, and only 2 confirmed blocks are needed for a
      transaction to be final. So, as always, it's a trade-off between security,
      transaction speed, and price.
    </p>
    <p>
      It's also possible to issue other tokens on the Liquid network. That could be
      a gift card, financial instruments, or a ticket to a concert, and so on. The
      first bond expected to be issued on Liquid is the long-awaited El Salvador
      Bitcoin bond, which may act as a catalyst for this type of use of the Liquid
      network.
    </p>
    <p>
      These tokens can be stored and sent extremely quickly and very
      cost-effectively, with a high degree of security. As with Bitcoin, Liquid
      lets you follow transactions in a block explorer, but the size of the
      transaction and which token is being sent, for example, can only be seen by
      the sender and recipient — so there's a fairly high degree of confidentiality.
      No matter which token is sent on Liquid, the transaction fee is always paid in
      L-BTC.
    </p>
    <p>
      When you talk about security and use the Bitcoin network as the benchmark,
      you can make most things sound insecure. It's important to say that, compared
      to the vast majority of other things, Liquid is incredibly secure. It will
      always be better to hold bitcoin on Liquid than on an online exchange, for
      example. You can also use
      <a href="https://store.blockstream.com/products/blockstream-jade-hardware-wallet?bg_ref=buvFujUbkv" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
        Blockstream's JADE hardware wallet</a>
      to ensure your private keys are generated offline, further securing your
      Liquid wallet.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="content-section">
    <h2>Getting started with Liquid</h2>
    <p>
      Below are a few links if you want to learn more or perhaps try using the
      Liquid network yourself.
    </p>
    <div class="callout">
      <p>
        <strong>
          A simple way to get L-BTC if you already have BTC is to download the
          Blockstream Green Wallet and set up a Liquid wallet. Then you can use
          <a href="https://sideshift.ai/btc/liquid" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
            sideshift.ai BTC/L-BTC</a>,
          where you enter a Liquid address and then send BTC to the BTC address
          shown to you on Sideshift. There's a small fee, and you'll soon receive
          sats in your Blockstream Green Liquid wallet. See the links below.
        </strong>
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="category-section">
    <h2>Tools and resources</h2>
    <div class="links-grid">
      <a href="https://store.blockstream.com/products/blockstream-jade-hardware-wallet?bg_ref=buvFujUbkv" class="link-card" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
        <span class="link-card-title">Buy a Blockstream JADE hardware wallet</span>
        <span class="link-card-arrow">→</span>
      </a>
      <a href="https://blockstream.com/liquid/" class="link-card" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
        <span class="link-card-title">Blockstream Liquid</span>
        <span class="link-card-arrow">→</span>
      </a>
      <a href="https://liquid.network/" class="link-card" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
        <span class="link-card-title">Mempool Liquid Block Explorer</span>
        <span class="link-card-arrow">→</span>
      </a>
      <a href="https://blockstream.info/liquid/" class="link-card" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
        <span class="link-card-title">Blockstream Liquid Block Explorer</span>
        <span class="link-card-arrow">→</span>
      </a>
      <a href="https://blockstream.com/green/" class="link-card" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
        <span class="link-card-title">Blockstream Green Wallet</span>
        <span class="link-card-arrow">→</span>
      </a>
      <a href="https://sideshift.ai/btc/liquid" class="link-card" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
        <span class="link-card-title">Sideshift.ai</span>
        <span class="link-card-arrow">→</span>
      </a>
      <a href="https://boltz.exchange/" class="link-card" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
        <span class="link-card-title">Boltz Exchange</span>
        <span class="link-card-arrow">→</span>
      </a>
      <a href="https://www.sideswap.io" class="link-card" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
        <span class="link-card-title">Sideswap</span>
        <span class="link-card-arrow">→</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="category-section">
    <h2>Read more</h2>
    <div class="links-grid">
      <a href="https://blog.liquid.net/the-truth-about-liquid/" class="link-card" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
        <span class="link-card-title">Article – The Truth About Liquid</span>
        <span class="link-card-arrow">→</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <a href="#" class="back-to-top"> ↑ Back to top </a>
</ResourcePageLayout>

<style>
  /* Navigation buttons */
  .nav-buttons {
    display: flex;
    gap: var(--space-md, 1rem);
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .nav-btn {
    flex: 1;
    min-width: 150px;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
    background-color: var(--primary);
    color: #000;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    border-radius: 6px;
    border: 1px solid var(--primary);
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
  }

  .nav-btn:hover {
    background-color: transparent;
    color: var(--primary);
  }

  /* Content sections */
  .content-section {
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: var(--text-light, #ccc);
  }

  .content-section h2 {
    color: var(--primary);
    font-size: 1.4rem;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md, 1rem);
    padding-bottom: var(--space-sm, 0.5rem);
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(247, 147, 26, 0.2);
  }

  .content-section p {
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .links-section {
    padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
    background: rgba(247, 147, 26, 0.04);
    border: 1px solid rgba(247, 147, 26, 0.12);
    border-radius: 10px;
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }

  .links-section p {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .links-section a {
    color: var(--primary);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 2px;
  }

  /* Feature block */
  .feature-block {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr;
    gap: 2rem;
    align-items: center;
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }

  .feature-image {
    text-align: center;
  }

  .feature-image img {
    max-width: 100%;
    border-radius: 8px;
  }

  /* Callout */
  .callout {
    padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
    background: rgba(247, 147, 26, 0.06);
    border-left: 3px solid rgba(247, 147, 26, 0.5);
    border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0;
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }

  .callout p {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  /* Category sections */
  .category-section {
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }

  .category-section h2 {
    color: var(--primary);
    font-size: 1.4rem;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md, 1rem);
    padding-bottom: var(--space-sm, 0.5rem);
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(247, 147, 26, 0.2);
  }

  /* Links grid */
  .links-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(250px, 1fr));
    gap: var(--space-md, 1rem);
  }

  .link-card {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
    border-radius: 12px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
    border: 1px solid rgba(247, 147, 26, 0.15);
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
  }

  .link-card:hover {
    background: rgba(247, 147, 26, 0.08);
    border-color: var(--primary);
    transform: translateY(-3px);
  }

  .link-card-title {
    color: var(--text-light, #ccc);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .link-card-arrow {
    color: var(--primary);
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    margin-left: 0.75rem;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  @media (max-width: 567px) {
    .nav-buttons {
      flex-direction: column;
    }

    .feature-block {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .links-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
